      "uid": "zhcn:2391e8c24d45cbaa89800180",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我一直在思考，该怎么做才能让苫小牧变有名。\n结论就是，只有在世界级的舞台大显身手才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "982d32afc655344de6380d74c54fc86ebc5169eba4d20b57b3c4b4f9cadef0be",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
