      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "两人持续高涨的热情交织在一起，\n这道相生的火焰，\n究竟能否传达给北港火山呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3a994460aaaa5083fc10c2dfda0297f99312664216596c7f406a60185dcf5c6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
